OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FMorning fog soon clearing to
OL,6,Fleave a fine day, with plenty of sunny
OL,7,Fspells, but the sunshine turning
OL,8,Fincreasingly hazy through the
OL,9,Fafternoon. Feeling pleasantly warm in
OL,10,Fthe sunshine, though a fairly brisk
OL,11,Feasterly breeze developing towards the
OL,12,Fsouth coast.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FA fine evening for all,
OL,15,Fthough staying rather breezy. Cloud
OL,16,Fincreasing overnight with a few
OL,17,Fshowers possible during the early
OL,18,Fhours, perhaps thundery for some.
OL,19,FTurning increasingly humid.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
