OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FA humid day, with a mixture
OL,6,Fof sunny spells and a scattering of
OL,7,Fshowers. Some of these could be heavy
OL,8,Fand thundery in places. Feeling warm
OL,9,Fin the sunnier moments.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FLow
OL,12,Fpressure moving in from the southwest
OL,13,Fwill bring an unsettled period, with
OL,14,Fheavy downpours and thunderstorms
OL,15,Flikely each day. Turning increasingly
OL,16,Fhumid, with temperatures staying a
OL,17,Flittle above average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
